rce workspace. Filed as pm-rl-warf.\n\nAll spec deliverables confirmed present on the branch: the >=3-generation real CLI acceptance with differing checkpoints and successor collection, regression/contamination/limit refusals, the manual host generation table in docs/lm-adapter.md, README recursive self-improvement section with the loop-lm example, RECURSIVE_TRAINING.md criterion 2 marked met for the CPU adapter (external Docker trainer still open), and the regenerated changelog (closed-items-only policy leaves it unchanged while this item is open; changelog:check passes). Next: commit the tracker writes, push, open the PR."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-07T07:40:00.752Z"}],"before_hash":"c9f16bffaec746b06c41d44f5dbf84ca14f1d784df4f03fc22346172376606df","after_hash":"ce9417fb85437540b9494931379b6a40609596eadeada98fd027d0e3153f04fd","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"7c9d8011605bcebf18ccbf3aacc5380c82ebaad8e4611676e0fdb88100f7d2e5"}
